<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Emerging growth company <span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span id="xdx_90E_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20240816__20240816_zurRBZshPU1l"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2024-08-16" format="ixt:booleantrue" id="Fact000028" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">x</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

